# 🌑 AETHERIA — AI CHARACTER / HERO + EMOTIONAL SYSTEM

> **A Hero is not a machine.**
>
> A Hero can fear, trust, hate, admire, regret, hope, become angry, lose motivation, and change because of what happens inside the Tower.
>
> The **AI Character / Hero + Emotional System** is responsible for simulating the psychological and behavioral state of every Hero in Aetheria.

---

# 1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW

The AI Character / Hero + Emotional System manages:

```text
Character AI
Emotion
Mood
Personality
Motivation
Fear
Stress
Morale
Trust
Loyalty
Relationship
Memory
Trauma
Decision Making
Behavior
Reaction
Dialogue Behavior
Combat Behavior
Social Behavior
Event Response
```

The system does not replace the Character System.

Instead:

```text
CHARACTER SYSTEM
        ↓
CHARACTER DATA
        ↓
AI + EMOTIONAL SYSTEM
        ↓
BEHAVIOR
        ↓
ACTION
        ↓
GAME STATE SYSTEM
```

