# 8. PERSONALITY STRENGTH

Personality traits should have intensity.

Example:

```text
Brave
0–20   Weak
21–40  Low
41–60  Moderate
61–80  Strong
81–100 Extreme
```

This allows two Heroes to have the same trait but behave differently.

---

# 9. PERSONALITY IS NOT EMOTION

Personality and emotion are different.

Example:

```text
Personality:
Calm

Current Emotion:
Angry
```

The Hero is normally calm but is currently angry because of an event.

Another example:

```text
Personality:
Brave

Current Emotion:
Fear
```

The Hero is naturally brave but can still become afraid.

