# 35. AI PRIORITY SYSTEM

The AI can evaluate actions using priority.

Example:

```text
ACTION A:
Attack Enemy

ACTION B:
Protect Master

ACTION C:
Retreat

ACTION D:
Help Injured Ally
```

The AI evaluates:

```text
Personality
Emotion
Motivation
Fear
Relationship
Loyalty
HP
Stress
Morale
Mission
```

Then calculates an action score.

Conceptually:

```text
ACTION SCORE =
Personality
+ Motivation
+ Relationship
+ Emotion
+ Situation
- Fear
- Stress
```

The exact formula should be configurable.

