# 67. AI + RNG SYSTEM

RNG should not randomly control every emotional decision.

RNG can introduce uncertainty.

Example:

```text
AI Decision:
Attack = 70%
Defend = 20%
Retreat = 10%

RNG
 ↓
Selected:
Defend
```

The AI creates the probability distribution.

RNG selects the final action when appropriate.

---

# 68. AI + RNG SAFETY

Important:

> RNG should not completely override character personality.

Example:

```text
Hero Fear = 95

Attack probability:
5%

Retreat:
75%

Defend:
20%
```

RNG operates within the AI-generated behavioral boundaries.

