# 🌑 82. CORE PHILOSOPHY

The goal of this system is not to make Heroes behave randomly.

The goal is to make their behavior **understandable**.

The player should eventually be able to think:

> "She did that because she remembers what happened on Floor 27."

or:

> "He refused because he is terrified of the Cult."

or:

> "She ignored the Master's order because her motivation to protect her companion was stronger."

or:

> "He became stronger after losing his family."

The player should feel that:

# **The Hero remembers.**

# **The Hero feels.**

# **The Hero decides.**

# **The Hero changes.**

